<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teva said lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teva said lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Teva Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd to outperform from buy, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3-15/16 to 52-9/16 in Nasdaq trading.</p>
</text>
